cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this bench in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Agent Runaway Bench"
abstract: >-
  What does an agent framework do when the model gets stuck repeating itself
  mid-reply? One fake model endpoint streams a single sentence on repeat (about
  300,000 characters) over the OpenAI Chat Completions or Responses wire, and logs two
  things per request: whether the client asked for an output cap, and how much it read
  before hanging up. No API keys and no spend; anyone can rerun it.
authors:
